      "content": "SP 90 SW              CHARTRIDGE              CHARTRIDGE                                               (north side) 5/28                                          Barn at Mapletree                                               Farm West to south of                                               farmhouse - GV                                            II Barn. C18. Timber framed on brick plinth, weatherboarded, old tile roof.  Projecting gabled cart entry on left, carriage arch formed through right-hand bay.  Small modern leaded windows.  Interior: three bays, curved braces to tiebeams, queen struts to collars. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9329003679"
    }
